B.a_c=new A.a4("Introduction","Last updated: 2 October 2026\nThe PerfectGest app processes the data described in this policy. This policy covers this app only, under Brazil's LGPD and Google Play rules. Trade name: PerfectGest. Website: https://perfectgestdev.com.")
B.a_j=new A.a4("Controller and contact","For access, correction or deletion: suporte@perfectgestdev.com.")
B.a_u=new A.a4("What the app does","PerfectGest is operational management on the phone: commercial agenda (clients and suppliers), quotes, work orders, cash, PDFs and local backup. You can use operations without a required subscription. An optional Pro plan exists (Google Play Billing; price on Play). No in-app ads.")
B.a0u=new A.a4("Storage","Business data stays on the device (SQLite). We do not automatically send clients, quotes, cash or PDFs to PerfectGest servers.\n\nWhen data may leave the device (only if you act)\n\n- Share or save PDF, business card, vCard or QR\n- Create and share a backup or export ZIP\n- Open links you choose (WhatsApp, email, Play Store, website)\n- Pick a logo with the system photo picker (no full-gallery access)")
B.ZA=new A.a4("Third-party services","- Firebase Analytics / Remote Config: generic usage events and version policy, without client names or money amounts.\n- Firebase Firestore: minimal technical record (device identifier / eligibility), without client files or cash movements.\n- Google Play Billing: only if you choose the optional Pro plan. Payments are handled by Google.\n- We do not use in-app ads or an advertising ID.")
B.ZP=new A.a4("Notifications","Notifications, if any, are local on the device.")
B.a0H=new A.a4("Rights","You can delete data in Settings or uninstall the app. Files you exported remain where you saved them. Firebase telemetry: request by email (up to 15 business days).")
B.a03=new A.a4("Changes","Updates are published on this page. In-app reference version: kPublicLegalDocumentsVersion.")
B.a0A=new A.a4("Legal identification (LGPD / Google Play)","Controller: PERFECT GEST DESENVOLVIMENTO DE SOFTWARE LTDA, CNPJ 66.889.409/0001-19. Website: https://perfectgestdev.com. Contact: suporte@perfectgestdev.com.")
